  "content": "\n\n<h1>空灵林地模组</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/syter2bSEV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1439707494896373833?color=7289DA&logo=discord&style=for-the-badge&logoColor=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/wiki-Does Not exist yet!!!-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=ReadMe&logoColor=white\" alt=\"维基\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fethereal-grove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ethereal-grove?label=Modrinth&logo=modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/ethereal-grove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1369948?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FF5103&label=CurseForge (DATAPACK)&color=FF5103\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ethereal-grove-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1372815?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FF5103&label=CurseForge (DATAPACK PACKAGED AS A MOD)&color=FF5103\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coder2195/ethereal-grove/forks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/coder2195/ethereal-grove?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=green\" alt=\"Fork 数\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coder2195/ethereal-grove/stargazers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/coder2195/ethereal-grove?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=yellow\" alt=\"Star 数\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coder2195/ethereal-grove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/languages/code-size/coder2195/ethereal-grove?style=for-the-badge&color=purple&logoColor=white\" alt=\"代码大小\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coder2195/ethereal-grove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/repo-size/coder2195/ethereal-grove?logo=dropbox&style=for-the-badge&color=red\" alt=\"仓库大小\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>‼️‼️ 本模组仅为便于安装，将数据包与资源包整合为一个 jar 文件。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/ethereal-grove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">访问原始数据包及信息的官方项目页面</a> ‼️‼️</strong></p>\n<p><strong>为什么不能直接将此 jar 文件上传至原项目？</strong></p>\n<p>因为我将该文件标记为数据包，CurseForge 的自动审核系统会阻止我将其作为模组化的数据包版本发布。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么一开始要采用整合包的形式？</strong></p>\n<p>根据其他 Minecraft 内容分发平台的统计数据，下载“模组化数据包”的用户数量远多于直接下载原版数据包的，因此这一需求应运而生。</p>",
